@startuml

footbox off

title Sequence Diagram - US007 Register a new country in the System


actor Administrator
participant ":UI" as UI



participant ":CountryController" as CountryController



participant ":CountryRepository" as AddressRepository


Administrator -> UI : **1** I want to register a new country
activate UI
UI --> Administrator : **2** What is the name of the country?
deactivate UI

Administrator -> UI : **3** The country is <countryName>
activate UI

UI -> CountryController : **4** registerNewCountry (countryName)
activate CountryController

CountryController -> AddressRepository : **5** createAndAddNewCountry (countryName)
activate AddressRepository


create "newCountry1: Country" as Country
AddressRepository -> Country : **6** createCountry(countryName)

AddressRepository -> AddressRepository : **7** validate (newCountry1)
AddressRepository -> AddressRepository : **8** Add (newCountry1)
AddressRepository --> CountryController : **9** (newCountry1)
deactivate AddressRepository

CountryController --> UI : **10** success!
deactivate CountryController

UI --> Administrator : **11** <newCountry1> registered successfully!
deactivate UI

@enduml